0.12.5 - Preformance fixes for windows, quality of life improvements.

0.12.4 - Wifi scan fixes, UI fixes

0.12.3 - Fix wifi scan bug windows, that may not identify networks correctly.

0.12.2 - Added edit button to network name on network scan page. Fixed issue with wifi names.

0.12.1 - UI tweaks and allows you to choose wifi adapter used for scan.

0.12.0 - Changed wifi and network devices history so the wifi networks and device are kept even if the orignal scan was deleted. Fix loading animation when doing network scanning. Add mechanism for the page to sleep if not actave for more than 1 hour.

0.11.1-2- - Testing release.

0.11.0 - Fixed various bugs and added various fail safes should the app fail to start up correctly. Various UI fixes. You can now protect speed test, ping and dns lookup results from the database clear tool if removing data older than a certain amount of time. Stopped user being able to hide all adaptors, you need to have atleast one visable. Also stop it from being able to use a hidden adaptor for anything.

0.10.0 - Major fixes and changes to improve and fix issues. This can now be run on a raspberry pi. Although I dont recommend anything earlier than a pi 4 due to preformance and hardware limitation it should still run on a pi 3. Major rework to the network scanning part, improving responsiveness and functionality.

0.9.2 - A few UI bug fixes. Added setting to allow you to disable the automatic launching of the webpage if you dont want it to when it starts (Usefull if you want to create a dedicated device for it). Added basic user authenication (Useful if running from dedicated device.). Able to change port number app is running on.

0.9.1 - A few UI fixes and clean up of dashboard code moving styles and scripts to seperate file. Added option to switch between production and dev environments

0.9.0 - New device history page allowing you to lookup history of devices found during network scans. Also added option to look through wifi networks. Few small bug fixes with mac address vendor lookup. Fixed search and it now remembers selected items between pages.

0.8.1-3 - Linux wifi speed fix

0.8.0 - Wifi scanning on mac os now posible. This version fixes it and allows that function to work on mac os.

0.7.14 - Minor bug fixes and fixing of export behaviour while filtering results. Now the export button will either export selected items, all items or filtered items depending on if anything is selected or not.

0.7.13 - Fix for incosistant network scan and now shows vendor ID's. Loading screen for interface list rather than being blank when page first loads.

0.7.12 - Inproved usability for touch screen devices by adding a toggle

0.7.11 - Updated github reference in setup script.

0.7.10 - Speed test bug fix.

0.7.9 - Bug fixes for network scan. Now labels Device used for scan as this device and the router as router in the list. If router isnt picked up in scan it will now inject it into the list. Can now press enter after setting name in speedtestbox to run speedtest, after putting in domain in dnslook up and address in ping test. Fix table for speedtest.

0.7.8 - Fix to reduce time app takes to start. Only fixes permissions of files if it needs to update or if downloading from github if app.py missing. Fixes network scanning issues. Speed test fixes. Added bulk deletion feature and bulk export of network and wifi scan csv.

0.7.7 - Fix to Windows launcher bat file to fix issue with starting when offline. Fix to setup script to fix issues when starting when offline

0.7.6 - Slightly updated setup script to launch web browser when ready.

0.7.5 - Inital Tests show it now should be stable. Switch from flask debug mode to using waitress. Version number are - Setup 0.7.1, app 0.7.3, dashboard 0.7.1. No plans to update past this point unless I find bugs to fix. Once I am happy it is stable will be bumped to 0.9.0 as the final beta version before 1.0

